# The lifecycle itself

The volumes above should operate across a formal **Systems Engineering V-model** rather than being written independently.

```text
                    MISSION
                       │
                       ▼
              STAKEHOLDER NEEDS
                       │
                       ▼
                SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS
                       │
                       ▼
                SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE
                       │
                       ▼
              SUBSYSTEM REQUIREMENTS
                       │
                       ▼
                DETAILED DESIGN
                       │
                       ▼
              IMPLEMENTATION
                       │
                       ▼
             INTEGRATION & TEST
                       │
                       ▼
                 VERIFICATION
                       │
                       ▼
                  VALIDATION
                       │
                       ▼
                CERTIFICATION
                       │
                       ▼
                   PRODUCTION
                       │
                       ▼
                  OPERATIONS
                       │
                       ▼
                 MAINTENANCE
                       │
                       ▼
                  RETIREMENT
```

And the critical traceability should run backwards:

```text
MISSION OBJECTIVE
      ↓
STAKEHOLDER REQUIREMENT
      ↓
SYSTEM REQUIREMENT
      ↓
SUBSYSTEM REQUIREMENT
      ↓
DESIGN ELEMENT
      ↓
IMPLEMENTATION
      ↓
TEST CASE
      ↓
TEST RESULT
      ↓
VERIFICATION EVIDENCE
      ↓
CERTIFICATION EVIDENCE
```

## The five master documents

Although there may ultimately be hundreds of individual documents, I'd make these **five the backbone of the BOLTE programme**:

1. **HFP-X Systems Engineering Management Plan — SEMP**
2. **HFP-X System Requirements Specification — SyRS**
3. **HFP-X System Architecture Description — SAD**
4. **HFP-X Verification & Validation Plan — V&V**
5. **HFP-X Safety & Airworthiness Case**

Everything else should trace back to these.

